cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CAT V2, CAT V3, or VLCM in research, please cite this repository."
title: "CAT V2, CAT V3 and VLCM: Concept-Based Neural-Symbolic Reasoning"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Kanth"
    given-names: "Chaman Prakash"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ChamanPrakashKanth/graph-llm-experiment"
url: "https://github.com/ChamanPrakashKanth/graph-llm-experiment"
abstract: >-
  Experimental concept-based neural-symbolic reasoning systems that map queries
  to explicit concept graphs, use graph neural networks and constrained path
  decoding, and explore sparse Graph-MoE routing for engineering, mathematics,
  and coding tasks.
keywords:
  - "concept graph"
  - "graph neural network"
  - "neural symbolic reasoning"
  - "Graph-MoE"
  - "concept attention transformer"
  - "VLCM"
  - "CAT V3"
  - "explainable AI"
  - "mechanical engineering AI"
